  "story": "A worker can do one job a day, on days 1, 2, 3 and so on. Job i pays pays[i], but only if it is done on or before day deadlines[i]; the jobs are listed by deadline. What is the most the worker can earn? With deadlines 1 1 and pays 3 7, there is time for one job: take the 7.",
